flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-riscv-host: State model explains what is remembered, committed, verified, or discarded."]
    N2["2. Input state: PolkaVM module | execution context | host syscall provider"]
    N3["3. Working state: guest memory, stack frame, host callback buffer"]
    N4["4. Persistent state: contract state, gas report, execution receipt"]
    N5["5. Transition: state changes through ABI, PolkaVM execution, and host syscall boundaries"]
    N6["6. Commitment: ABI digest, execution result, gas report, and syscall trace"]
    N7["7. Finality: host accepts result and includes state change in L2 transition"]
    N8["8. Rollback or reject: reject ABI, guest fault, or host callback; do not commit state change"]
    N1 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N1 --> N4
    N1 --> N5
    N1 --> N6
    N1 --> N7
    N1 --> N8
    N2 -. constrains .-> N4
    N4 -. produces .-> N5
    N5 -. consumed by .-> N6
